  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "one beorg, \u00feeh \u00fee ymb \u00feone tieman w\u00e6ren swa micel Ac for \u00fe\u00e6m he gene\u00f0de swi\u00feost ofer \u00feone munt \u00fee he wiste \u00fe\u00e6t Flamineus se consul wende \u00fe\u00e6t Mid \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Hannibal to \u00f0\u00e6m londe becom, swa gewicade he an anre diegelre stowe, neah \u00fe\u00e6m & sum his folc sende gind \u00fe\u00e6t lond to b\u00e6rnanne & to hergenne, \u00fe\u00e6tte se consul w\u00e6s wenende & Hannibales folces w\u00e6s twa M ofslagen. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Scipia se consul, \u00fe\u00e6s o\u00feres Scipian bro\u00feor, w\u00e6s monega gefeoht donde on Ispanium, & monega wundor gewurdon on \u00fe\u00e6re tide. \u00c6rest w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t seo sunne w\u00e6s swelce heo w\u00e6re eall gelytladu. O\u00feer w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6t mon geseah swelce seo sunne & se mona fuhte: \u00feas wundor gewurdon on Arpis & on Sardinium mon geseah twegen sceldas blode sw\u00e6tan. & Falisci \u00fe\u00e6t folc hie gesawon swelce se hefon w\u00e6re tohliden. & Athium \u00fe\u00e6t folc him ge\u00feuhte, \u00fea hie heora corn ripon, & heora cawelas afylled h\u00e6fdon, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s V hunde wintrum & feowertegum, \u00fea \u00fea Lucius Amilius Ac he hie mid \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan wrence beswac \u00fee he \u00e6t heora \u00e6rran gemetingge dyde, & eac mid \u00fe\u00e6m Ac ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee Hannibal to his fultume com, he gefliemde ealle \u00fea consulas, & on Romanum \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Hannibal sende ham to Cartaina \u00ferio my",
